1704
01:23:00,370 --> 01:23:02,930
So it's able to power all of these things.

1705
01:23:02,930 --> 01:23:06,290
In fact, I believe the underlying model for Grokbot is Grok46.

1706
01:23:06,290 --> 01:23:10,450
