7243
06:24:53,540 --> 06:24:57,540
So if you're selling, say, for GrokBot into a go-to-market org,

7244
06:24:57,540 --> 06:25:03,540
someone can actually help you pull in information on, OK, here's actually the leader for maybe their SDR team.

7245
06:25:03,540 --> 06:25:05,540
