7246
06:25:05,540 --> 06:25:08,540
And it's pushing all that context back into GrokBot.

7247
06:25:08,540 --> 06:25:11,540
And it's pushing it all back into the system and this understanding.

7248
06:25:11,540 --> 06:25:14,540
And again, back to the voice of the customer bot.

7249
06:25:14,540 --> 06:25:19,540
Maybe they said, oh, yes, Simon on the SDR go-to-market team is looking into these exact things.

7250
06:25:19,540 --> 06:25:22,540
And it can talk with other bots like our company research bot here.

7251
06:25:22,540 --> 06:25:27,540
Pull that context back in of who exactly that is, where they sit in the org chart,

7252
06:25:27,540 --> 06:25:32,540
and help you actually sequence that and rank that based on, here's how high they are up in the company they are.

7253
06:25:32,540 --> 06:25:35,540
Like, are they the economic buyer based on stuff like that?

7254
06:25:35,540 --> 06:25:38,540
And so really, you can kind of have these all work together.

7255
06:25:38,540 --> 06:25:45,540
And again, I think this goes back to the point of the importance of building all your bots from your chief of staff bot

7256
06:25:45,540 --> 06:25:47,540
is it understands this context better.

7257
06:25:47,540 --> 06:25:49,540
And it understands it just like you would.

7258
06:25:50,820 --> 06:25:53,820
And so moving forward here, I've kind of talked a lot about the voice of the customer bot.

7259
06:25:53,820 --> 06:25:57,820
