7272
06:26:45,820 --> 06:26:50,820
And this is something I've really seen as like a practical way to scale some of the long running tasks

7273
06:26:50,820 --> 06:26:55,820
and some of the ones that really have slowed down some of my workflows in the short term.

7274
06:26:55,820 --> 06:26:58,820
And so this has really helped me kind of stay on top of those things.

7275
06:26:58,820 --> 06:27:04,820
