7283
06:27:32,180 --> 06:27:38,180
Because I think it's so easy to be overwhelmed as an SDR with all these different tasks and all these different things you have to do.

7284
06:27:39,180 --> 06:27:45,180
And it's really hard to kind of mentally try and try and understand and rank these different prospects.

7285
06:27:45,180 --> 06:27:52,180
And so I think having some sort of like systematic ranking here with Grokba as I've kind of built myself is a really good way to do this.

