7369
06:33:09,880 --> 06:33:12,160
Why do I need a second bot for that?

7370
06:33:12,160 --> 06:33:14,600
And also on that note, when should I just turn things

7371
06:33:14,600 --> 06:33:16,640
into routines that that bot runs?

7372
06:33:16,640 --> 06:33:18,760
But really, I emphasize kind of thinking

7373
06:33:18,760 --> 06:33:22,320
about all these different things as ways for you

7374
06:33:22,320 --> 06:33:26,750
to actually just save more tokens in the first place,

7375
06:33:26,750 --> 06:33:29,350
but actually just also not confuse yourself

7376
06:33:29,350 --> 06:33:31,710
and not kind of just get overloaded with bots

7377
06:33:31,710 --> 06:33:34,310
that are just doing kind of similar things.

7378
06:33:34,310 --> 06:33:37,030
And again, making these through your chief of staff

