They are billed.

8981
07:39:41,740 --> 07:39:46,220
So it sort of runs the setup and the infrastructure, reply.

8982
07:39:46,220 --> 07:39:49,860
So this actually answers users in both our ticketing system

8983
07:39:49,860 --> 07:39:51,420
and then Slack.

8984
07:39:51,420 --> 07:39:52,380
